<title>USA: Fidelity National Financial sets stock div.</title>
<headline>Fidelity National Financial sets stock div.</headline>
<dateline>IRVINE, Calif. 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fidelity National Financial Inc said on Wednesday its board of directors declared a 10 percent stock dividend and a cash dividend of $0.07 per share to all holders of its common stock.</p>
<p>The 10 percent stock dividend will be payable on January 7, 1997, to stockholders of record as of December 23.</p>
<p>The quarterly cash dividend will be paid on January 27, 1997, to stockholders of record on January 17, 1997.</p>
<p>The 10 percent stock dividend will increase the company's shares outstanding to 13,746,766 from 12,497,060, it said.</p>
